#: man-cvsrevertlast.1.docbook:20
#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid "Revert files in CVS by one version"
msgstr "CVS मध्ये सञ्चिकाः एकेन संस्करणेन पुनः स्थापयन्तु"

#: man-cvsrevertlast.1.docbook:24
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvsrevertlast</command> "
"<group><option><replaceable>filename</replaceable></option></group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvsrevertlast इति</command><group><option><replaceable> "
"सञ्चिकानाम</replaceable></option></group>"

#: man-cvsrevertlast.1.docbook:32
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

#: man-cvsrevertlast.1.docbook:34
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"cvsrevertlast is used to revert all the files on the command line by one "
"version in CVS. The files will not be committed."
msgstr ""
"cvsrevertlast इत्यस्य उपयोगः आदेशपङ्क्तौ सर्वाणि सञ्चिकाः CVS मध्ये एकेन "
"संस्करणेन प्रत्यावर्तयितुं भवति । सञ्चिकाः प्रतिबद्धाः न भविष्यन्ति ।"

#: man-cvsrevertlast.1.docbook:37
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This utility is part of the KDE Software Development Kit."
msgstr "इयं उपयोगिता KDE Software Development Kit इत्यस्य भागः अस्ति ।"

